// (3) out_different: Each bit of this output vector should indicate whether the corresponding input bit is different from its neighbour to the left. For example, out_different[18] should indicate if in[18] is different from in[19]. For this part, treat the vector as wrapping around, so in[19]'s neighbour to the left is in[0].

module top_module (
	input [19:0] in,
	output [18:0] out_both,
	output [19:1] out_any,
	output [19:0] out_different);

