description:
Design a 4-bit binary counter that increments its count on each positive edge of the clock when enabled. The counter resets to zero when the reset signal (rst) is activated. Additionally, it outputs a signal indicating when it has reached its maximum count value of 15 (binary 1111).
module top_module(
    input clk, rst, en,
    output reg [3:0] count,
    output reg max
);

code:
module top_module(
    input clk, rst, en,
    output reg [3:0] count,
    output reg max
);always @(posedge clk, posedge rst)
begin
    if (rst)
        count <= 4'b0;
    else if (en)
        count <= count + 1;
end

assign max = (count == 4'b1111);

endmodule

